<title>UK: J.D. Wetherspoon managing director resigns.</title>
<headline>J.D. Wetherspoon managing director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pub operator J.D. Wetherspoon Plc said on Tuesday that Mark McQuater resigned as managing director to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>&quot;In future, the management board will continue its responsibilities for day to day operational issues,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
